// `id > 1` goes into the query, but `score.round() < 0` has no translation and
// stays in the pipeline. The limit counts events after both, so it stays, too:
// with `LIMIT 1` in the query, only row 2 would arrive, which the remaining
// filter then drops.
from_duckdb env("DUCKDB_SEED"), table="events"
where id > 1 and score.round() < 0
head 1
select id
